 srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%93%E7%8F%80%E8%8A%B1%E7%8E%AF\" title=\"库珀花环\"><img alt=\"库珀花环\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%93%E7%8F%80%E8%8A%B1%E7%8E%AF\" title=\"库珀花环\">库珀花环</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>4.0</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>行与思七则</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：311705</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311705/库珀花环皮肤skill1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311705/库珀花环皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175945.887.png\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311705/库珀花环皮肤skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311705/库珀花环皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175945.887.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311705/库珀花环皮肤unique.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311705/库珀花环皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175945.887.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311705/库珀花环皮肤born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311705/库珀花环皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175945.887.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">哪怕什么都不做，星星也还是永恒地旋转吗？<br />不，并不是这样的。星轨的排列并不如人们想象的那样稳定。贪吃的星体有时会把伴星吸到嘴边，彗星的尾巴常常在喷流中被吹乱。少女第一次听说这些故事时便感到担忧——会有人像她整理散落的道具那样，将摔倒的星环扶正吗？会有人像她领着小羊那样，将坠落的星辰嵌回属于它的星座吗？<br />迷失的星星理当有一位引航者，它会回到正确的轨道，而在宇宙行走的孩子，正巧可以做到这一点。而这些被排列的星迹，终会为下一位迷失的旅人指引方向。<br />她如此相信着，她如此期待着。今夜的梦里，她穿行在牧群之间，俯身捧起一片即将坠入视界的星光。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"311705\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d2/Belonging-311710.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">曲柄牧杖<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Shepherdess's Crook</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />15<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一支缀着铜质星星与小羊挂饰的牧杖。它曾钩住离群之羊的小腿，也为动物们指引方向。受访者表示自己偶尔会有不自觉将其横拿的情况，这与她曾经从事高空钢丝表演的职业经历有关。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3b/Belonging-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">草垛与篷尖<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Tiny Tent Peak</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />10<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>绘有金色星星、顶端有着飞马装饰的尖顶帽。帽子的造型总让她想起马戏团帐篷的尖顶，还有车队前行时，田野上一闪而过的草垛——有时候，它们会陪着她一起在星星下发呆。<br />如今她行走在更广阔的天宇下，这顶帽子便是她携带的一顶小小的帷帐。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f9/Belonging-311712.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“希望”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Hope\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />12<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>带有水仙绣片与翅膀形状绑带的围裙。受访者十分喜欢它的设计寓意——“即使短暂陷入休眠，水仙也会等到合适的时机开花，就像安静的翅膀会在奔跑时随风飞起来。”<br />“不过，有时也会出现这样的麻烦。”受访者说着，将过长的拖尾从羊羔正在咀嚼的嘴中抢救了出来。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">牧于晚星 <small style=\"color: grey\">Star Shepherdess</small></span></span>"}}